3. Setup database di server
4. Run Django dengan production server (Gunicorn)
5. Setup domain & HTTPS

**Tools:** Git, Docker (optional), Nginx, Gunicorn

---

#### **OPSI B: Platform as a Service (Heroku, Railway, Render) - Lebih mudah**

```
Platform handle setup server, kamu cukup:
1. Push code ke Git
2. Connect Git ke platform
3. Platform auto-detect Django project
4. Platform auto-setup venv & install dependencies
5. DONE! ✅

URL: https://your-app.railway.app (auto-generated)
```

**Paling mudah untuk pemula!** Platform handle semua technical stuff.

