id: 1, batch_id: 1, serial: 010303202601, status: available
id: 2, batch_id: 1, serial: 010303202602, status: available
...
id: 50, batch_id: 1, serial: 010303202650, status: available

Kasir scan: 010303202601
System: Item 1 terjual → status: sold
```

**Pros:**
- ✅ Tracking paling detail (tahu box mana yang terjual)
