### KRITERIA 2: Sistem (Database & Performance)

**Solusi 1 (Batch) - Database:**
```sql
ProductBatch (1 row per batch)
- 1 bulan = ~100 batch records (20 produk x 5x input/bulan)
- 1 tahun = 1,200 batch records
- Query: Fast (index by product_id, tanggal)

StockMovement (history)
- 1 transaksi jual 5 item = 5 rows (batch_id tracked)
- 100 transaksi/hari = 500 rows/hari
- 1 tahun = 180K rows (manageable)
```

**Solusi 3 (Serial) - Database:**
```sql
StockItem (1 row per item fisik!)
- 1 bulan input 12,000 items (400/hari x 30 hari)
- 1 tahun = 144,000 item records
- Query: Slow (need scan available items, update status)

StockMovementItem (1 row per item movement)
- 1 transaksi jual 5 items = 5 rows (serial tracked)
- 100 transaksi/hari = 500 rows/hari
- Plus: 12K rows/bulan for stock in
- 1 tahun = 324K rows (heavy)
```

**Performance:**
- Solusi 1: Query batch, aggregate qty → Fast
- Solusi 3: Query available items, loop update → Slower

**Winner: Solusi 1** (better performance, manageable data)

