## 🔒 Collision Prevention Strategy

### **Current Code Generation:**

```python
# ❌ POTENTIAL PROBLEM (walaupun unlikely)
new_code = ''.join(random.choices(string.ascii_uppercase + string.digits, k=6))
# AB12CD - tapi gimana kalau udah ada???
```

