### **Proper Fix (Restructure):**
```python
# Separate models:
class TechnicalAdmin(AbstractBaseUser):
    # No business field
    # is_superuser required
    
class BusinessUser(AbstractBaseUser):  
    business = ForeignKey(Business)
    # is_superuser=False always
```

