**Separated User Models (FINAL SOLUTION):**
```python
# TechnicalAdmin - Django admin ONLY
class TechnicalAdmin(AbstractBaseUser):
    username = CharField(unique=True)  # Global
    is_staff = True
    is_superuser = True
    # NO business association

# BusinessUser - POS operations ONLY  
class BusinessUser(AbstractBaseUser):
    business = ForeignKey(Business)     # Multi-tenant
    username = CharField()              # Unique per business
    role = CharField()                  # admin/kasir
    is_staff = False                    # NO Django admin
    is_superuser = False
```

